## Illinois partner feedback

Illinois asked what testing is planned and specifically named:
- end users;
- court clerks;
- Court Guides at Illinois Court Help;
- ADA/accessibility.

## Scope

Create a launch-readiness test plan covering at least:
- Start a new case;
- File into an existing case;
- drafts/resume;
- payment and fee-waiver paths;
- Review and Submit;
- submitted filing/status/refile paths;
- desktop and mobile/small viewport behavior;
- keyboard-only and screen-reader use;
- acces
